# UI Design System

## Hierarchy

```
ui/tokens/     cn(), colors — no components
ui/primitives/ Button, Input, Card, Badge — atomic, variant-based
ui/patterns/   AppShell, FlowBar, NarrativeCard — composed layouts
```

Patterns import primitives and tokens. Primitives never import patterns.

## Styling

- Tailwind CSS v4 with semantic tokens: `bg-base`, `text-primary`, `text-secondary`, `border-subtle`, `bg-accent`, `text-on-accent`
- Use `cn()` from `@/ui/tokens/cn` for conditional classes
- Brand palette in `@/ui/tokens/colors` — black + green primary, white + orange secondary
- `font-mono tabular-nums` for currency amounts; `formatCurrency()` from `cn.ts`

## Component rules

- Functional components, extend native HTML attribute types
- Variants as `Record<Variant, string>` maps — see `Button`
- No Prisma, no fetch, no business logic — receive typed props from pages
- Client components (`"use client"`) only when using hooks or event handlers

## Patterns

- **AppShell**: header, context switcher, mobile nav, logout
- **FlowBar**: visualizes `MoneyFlow[]` with context accent (`personal` | `business`)
- **NarrativeCard**: renders `NarrativeFeedItem` from domain

When adding UI, check existing primitives before creating new ones. Match spacing (`space-y-8` sections, `rounded-lg`, `text-sm` labels).
